# Security

- No secrets in source, webpack bundles, or deployment zips
- Do not log Authorization headers or tokens
- CFN TOKEN authorizer + CUSTOM methods are runtime truth
- Never `npm audit fix --force`
- See `docs/SECURITY.md`
